WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.501
Worried and angry parents are

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.269
turning out in droves in Tehran

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:04.404
and other cities across

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:05.338
Iran, challenging

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.840
that regime, demanding answers

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.174
after a wave of suspected

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.376
poisoning attacks

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:10.076
on hundreds

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.945
of schoolgirls across the country.

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:12.746
Some parents are calling

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:14.547
these targeted and deliberate attempts

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:15.415
to keep their girls

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:16.449
from getting an education.

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:17.517
Let's go to our Nima Elbagir

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.052
who's been covering this for us.

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:20.820
She joins us from London Good morning.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.423
This is really a significant development

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:23.990
over the weekend

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.725
because these are parents

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:26.426
in rage

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:29.396
demanding answers from the regime.

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:31.831
Obviously, Poppy, and at huge

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:32.899
personal risk.

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:33.933
We've uncovered

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.101
evidence that highlights

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.137
the extent of the risks

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:38.271
parents are taking.

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:39.939
Take a look at this

00:00:42.776 --> 00:00:44.344
Furious parents outside

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:48.148
an education office in Tehran

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:51.751
challenging Iranian authorities desperate

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:52.619
for answers

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.191
after what is believed

00:00:58.191 --> 00:00:58.324
to be

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:00.126
the worst day of incidents

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:02.595
of suspected poisonings at girls schools.

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:04.831
These videos were filmed on Saturday,

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.800
which marks the start of the school week

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:07.867
in Iran.

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:09.836
For months now, Iranian schoolgirls

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:10.670
and their families

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:11.671
have been speaking out

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:13.273
about incidents of suspected

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.007
poisoning

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:15.241
The numbers of incidents

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.377
reported to CNN in the dozens.

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:20.246
Then over the weekend, dozens more.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.148
CNN was able to verify

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.050
these new incidents using video

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:25.518
and witness testimony.

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:28.354
Across ten provinces, the U.S.

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:29.456
and others are calling

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:30.690
for Iran's authorities

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.492
to investigate these incidents.

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:33.560
But speaking to CNN,

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:34.294
medical sources

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:35.361
say they have been barred

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.030
by hospital administrators

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:38.164
from sharing details

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:40.266
of symptoms and test results,

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:42.235
even with the patient's parents.

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:43.536
We dub this doctor's

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:45.205
voice for his safety.

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:46.773
I'm inside Iran.

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.408
My phone is being monitored.

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:50.009
I can't show any more with you.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.377
Iran's interior minister,

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.379
after months of vague statements

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:54.247
now says

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:56.483
suspicious samples have been found

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:58.985
and are being assessed at laboratories.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:00.453
Parents, though, say

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:02.388
they don't trust authorities

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:03.289
to investigate

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:06.659
To hell with this country and its rulers.

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:09.129
We would be better off without a leader.

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:10.597
This is our country.

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:12.165
They don't know what they're doing.

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:14.667
They don't even have medicine.

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:15.502
All the incidents

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:17.203
begin in a similar manner

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:19.239
as described to us by students.

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:20.406
A noxious smell.

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:22.742
And then I felt dizzy and fainted.

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:24.277
I had dimness of vision

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:26.279
and heart palpitations.

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:27.614
All of us had identical

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:29.449
symptoms, palpitations.

00:02:29.449 --> 00:02:31.784
My hands and legs were numb and frozen.

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:32.886
I was shaken.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:36.256
We had tears coming out of our eyes.

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:38.458
With no one so far

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:39.926
held to account and parents

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:41.494
no closer to answers.

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:42.362
Many continue

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:43.596
to risk their lives

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:45.632
to challenge Iran's authorities

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:49.536
The US State Department

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:51.704
last week called for Iranian authorities

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:52.872
to investigate these incidents.

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:54.407
But as you see there,

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:55.141
people inside

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:57.744
Iran do not trust authorities

00:02:58.044 --> 00:02:59.579
not only to investigate this,

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:00.580
but with the lives of

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:01.981
their children Poppy.

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:02.382
And never

00:03:02.382 --> 00:03:03.383
before you go

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:04.851
now here in the United States,

00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:06.286
the head of the Senate

00:03:06.286 --> 00:03:07.020
Foreign Relations

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.021
Committee, Senator Menendez,

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:09.489
is calling on the United Nations

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:10.290
to investigate

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.926
what CNN's investigation has uncovered.

00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:16.596
Are these secret torture centers across

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:17.931
the country? Is that right?

00:03:19.132 --> 00:03:19.832
Absolutely.

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:20.767
And we've

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:21.434
already been hearing

00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:22.835
from some of our sources this morning,

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:23.836
and they really feel it's

00:03:23.836 --> 00:03:25.371
a huge vindication

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:26.372
for the huge risks

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:27.607
that they took in speaking to us.

00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:29.609
But just to kind of pull out a little bit

00:03:29.609 --> 00:03:31.678
and also to contextualize this for you

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:32.912
speaks to the ways

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:33.947
that the US is now

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:35.114
pushing much harder

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:36.316
on an international stage

00:03:36.316 --> 00:03:37.951
because the Senate Foreign Relations

00:03:37.951 --> 00:03:39.619
Committee is the US government's

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:41.087
foreign policy lead.

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:43.423
And this is a big push on their part

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:44.991
to specifically say

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:46.059
Iranian authorities

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:48.661
need to be investigated internationally.

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:50.096
It speaks to the US

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:52.031
trying to take a harder line on

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:53.333
what the Iran

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:55.768
regime is doing to its own people, Poppy.

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:57.237
The real question is going to be

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:58.471
how much access can the U.N.

00:03:58.471 --> 00:04:00.406
get and what sort of teeth of course

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:01.741
do they have now?

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:03.576
Great reporting as always. Thank you.

